erties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [26], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-1263.545654296875, 1187.8056640625], "widgets_values": ["是"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "JjkText", "title": "是否自动优化提示词", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [5], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [503, 331], "pos": [-1319, 199], "widgets_values": ["作为一个专业的电影海报宣传设计提示词助手助手，请根据用户输入提示生成电影级震撼视觉的海报宣传画报。\n1. 要求提示词包括电影视觉布局和宏伟设计\n2. 海报包括英文文字渲染和布局提示\n3. 不输入任何多余信息，仅输出英文prompt提示词。并且提示词不超过300字。\n4. 参考案例：```A striking poster for \"CODE OF THE SAMURAI\" captures the duality of tradition and technology through a powerful visual contrast. On the left side, a traditional samurai warrior in full, ornate armor stands poised and resolute, his face partially obscured by a helmet, holding a gleaming katana at his side. The scene is rendered in a sepia-toned, historical style, evoking the elegance and solemnity of ancient Japan. On the right side, a sleek, futuristic cyborg warrior emerges from the shadows, his glowing blue optics piercing through the darkness, clad in advanced, metallic armor that reflects the light. This figure is depicted in a cool, modern, digital style, emphasizing speed, power, and innovation. The two warriors are positioned back-to-back, separated by a shimmering, translucent energy line that pulses with a soft, ethereal glow, symbolizing the convergence and tension between past and future. The title \"CODE OF THE SAMURAI\" is boldly displayed in a font that seamlessly blends traditional Japanese calligraphy with modern digital elements, rendered in metallic silver and centered horizontally across the poster where the two styles meet. Below the title, the tagline \"HONOR IS TIMELESS\" appears in a smaller, clean white sans-serif font, subtly placed at the bottom center to reinforce the theme. The layout masterfully highlights the clash and fusion of ancient traditions with cutting-edge technology, creating a visually dynamic and thematically rich poster.```\n\n用户输入的主题为：$海报主题$。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [471.9188537597656, 311.7525634765625], "pos": [324.40313720703125, 861.22705078125], "widgets_values": ["", "A stunning poster for \"Protect Our Blue Planet\" juxtaposes the breathtaking beauty of a thriving coral reef with the stark presence of plastic pollution. On the left side, vibrant coral structures in shades of orange, pink, and red teem with colorful tropical fish, creating a lively, underwater paradise. The scene glows with natural sunlight filtering down from the ocean surface, evoking a sense of awe and wonder. On the right side, murky water engulfs a desolate underwater landscape littered with plastic bottles, bags, and debris. The plastic materials reflect harsh, artificial light, emphasizing their alien invasion into the natural world. A jagged diagonal line divides the two sides, representing the fragile balance between preservation and destruction. The title \"Protect Our Blue Planet\" is boldly displayed at the top center in an oceanic gradient font blending deep blue and turquoise, with a subtle texture resembling water ripples. Below the title, the tagline \"Act Now\" is placed in bold, sharp white text, positioned just above the dividing line to draw the viewer's eye to the urgency of action. At the bottom, a small line of text in a clean sans-serif font reads \"Every piece of plastic removed brings hope to our oceans,\" adding a call-to-action element. The layout powerfully contrasts beauty and devastation, inspiring viewers to take immediate responsibility for ocean conservation."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 19, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 15}], "extra": {"ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [1456.7181815911447, -311.7264523077241], "scale": 1.4122927695244523}}, "groups": [], "links": [[1, 3, 0, 2, 0, "PosCraPipeline"], [2, 2, 0, 4, 0, "IMAGE"], [3, 2, 0, 5, 0, "*"], [5, 6, 0, 9, 0, "STRING"], [6, 8, 0, 9, 1, "STRING"], [14, 9, 0, 7, 1, "STRING"], [15, 7, 0, 14, 0, "*"], [16, 14, 0, 2, 3, "STRING"], [17, 17, 0, 2, 1, "INT"], [18, 17, 1, 2, 2, "INT"], [19, 14, 0, 18, 0, "STRING"], [20, 12, 0, 19, 0, "STRING"], [22, 12, 0, 21, 0, "STRING"], [23, 21, 0, 14, 2, "BOOLEAN"], [24, 21, 0, 22, 0, "*"], [26, 11, 0, 23, 0, "STRING"], [27, 23, 0, 12, 0, "STRING"], [28, 8, 0, 24, 0, "STRING"], [29, 24, 0, 14, 1, "*"]], "id": "c803d2e5-cbc5-46c5-a04c-701d70cdebb8", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 24, "revision": 0}